    "abstract": "Climate change is bringing an inevitable change to planet earth. One of the recent victims of climate change is Pakistan, in the form of a disastrous ood that leads to severe food insecurity throughout the country. Recent food insecurity results from damage done by the ood to agricultural land, which have an extreme effect on districts marked by highly malnourished populations.",
